# A theme that celebrates its agents' moments: when an agent lands, a burst of sparks
# plays once at its pane's top right. The director hands over the moment a core would fold.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
replies sparkle-replies.json
project storefront shop
core saveTheme sparkle.json
prefer themeId custom-sparkle-rice
prefer paneBackdrop theme
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Cache the product pages so a page loads without asking the database each time."
settle 6
front Wren
settle 2
moment Wren
hold 0.3
snap sparkle
